      <td>Outsourced code factory focused purely on billable hours and ticket counts.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Mobile Native Execution</strong></td>
      <td><strong>Native Kotlin & Swift 6</strong> with 60–120 FPS performance and minimal battery footprint.</td>
      <td>Sluggish web wrappers and unoptimized cross-platform generic templates.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Store Deployment</strong></td>
      <td><strong>Guaranteed App Store & Play Store approval</strong> with automated Fastlane CI/CD pipelines.</td>
      <td>Hands off after delivery; leaves App Store rejections and guideline hurdles to the client.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Architecture & Code</strong></td>
      <td><strong>Modular Clean Architecture</strong>, 99.9% crash-free SLA, zero security tech debt.</td>
      <td>Monolithic spaghetti code, undocumented hacks, and missing test coverage.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Intelligence Integration</strong></td>
      <td><strong>Built-in AI/ML</strong> (CoreML, TFLite, RAG) for personalized, predictive user experiences.</td>
      <td>Basic static CRUD features without intelligent workflow automation.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

